- Short mono sub synth with fast release.
- Prepared celesta with felt and paper damping.
- Large tupan-style double-headed drum or low frame drum used sparsely.
- Bass trumpet with cup or plunger mute.
- Short bright chamber, narrow plate, dark brass room, parallel drum compression, and restrained transformer saturation.

